        "title": "Functional Linear Algebra",
        "abstract": "A functional implementation of linear algebra with less mutability and more abstractions may save efforts, space, and processor time. An efficient and practical implementation of PCA as an example. Linear Algebra is how you eventually solve Deep Learning and most other Statistical Machine Learning problems.",
